---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Ryan Laird">
  <Nav />

  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="container about-shell">
      <header class="about-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Hi, I’m Ryan Laird.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          I’m a digital developer and science communicator building accessible,
          data-driven web experiences with Astro, React, TypeScript, and Python.
          I care about clear communication, inclusive design, and making complex
          ideas feel understandable.
        </p>

        <div class="badge-row" aria-label="Profile badges">
          <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Role-Digital%20Developer-7c3aed?style=for-the-badge&logo=code&logoColor=white" alt="Role: Digital Developer" />
          <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Stack-Astro%20%7C%20React%20%7C%20TypeScript-0f766e?style=for-the-badge&logo=astro&logoColor=white" alt="Stack: Astro, React, TypeScript" />
          <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Focus-Accessibility%20%26%20Inclusive%20Design-2563eb?style=for-the-badge&logo=accessibility&logoColor=white" alt="Focus: Accessibility and Inclusive Design" />
          <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Location-UK-111827?style=for-the-badge&logo=unitedkingdom&logoColor=white" alt="Location: UK" />
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="readme-card">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          I build websites and content systems that balance design, performance,
          and maintainability. My work often spans frontend development,
          structured content, automation, API integration, and science-focused
          communication.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="readme-grid">
        <article class="readme-card">
          <h2>What I work on</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Astro and React sites with reusable component systems.</li>
            <li>TypeScript-backed content pipelines and structured schemas.</li>
            <li>API integrations for project, CV, and research data.</li>
            <li>Automation for content syncing, assets, and research workflows.</li>
            <li>Accessible interfaces and clearer digital communication.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

